   "h": 891,
   "w": 1901,
   "texts": [
    {
     "tag": "H2",
     "cls": "t1-tit",
     "t": "80,000Lux anti-interference ability of ambient light",
     "fs": 32,
     "fw": "500",
     "c": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
     "box": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 13.3,
      "w": 100,
      "h": 3.9
     }
    },
    {
     "tag": "P",
     "cls": "t1-txt",
     "t": "With advanced anti-interference technology, LPX-T1 can effectively deal with the interference of ambient light and sunlight. Whether it is a complex indoor environment or a scene with strong outdoor light, it can operate stably and provide reliable environmental awareness.",
