     "t": "In order to improve user development efficiency, SLAMTEC has developed the development software RobotStudio. RobotStudio provides users with professional LiDAR debugging tools. At the same time, SLAMTEC also provides users with SDK development kits that can run on x86 windows, x86 Linux, arm Linux and other platforms to match Various development applications.",
