    {
     "tag": "P",
     "cls": "t1-txt",
     "t": "The features and performance of the LPX-T1 make it suitable for a variety of flexible and diverse application scenarios. It can be widely used in industrial vehicles (AGV), service robots, lightweight autonomous driving (unmanned vehicles in parks) and other fields. Whether it is warehousing logistics, smart manufacturing or autonomous driving systems, LPX-T1 can provide accurate and reliable environment perception and navigation support for different applications.",
